"value" [:answer.type/math "y={e}^{-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}+K"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/state.json" "file_sha256" "f588af69fd6a70003e4b83c52e2208b3c81dd1ea2734b6e1b44421fe2bea8532" "basis" 1244 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158014" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "y={e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}+K"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/state.json" "file_sha256" "f588af69fd6a70003e4b83c52e2208b3c81dd1ea2734b6e1b44421fe2bea8532" "basis" 1244 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158014" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "y=K{e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/state.json" "file_sha256" "f588af69fd6a70003e4b83c52e2208b3c81dd1ea2734b6e1b44421fe2bea8532" "basis" 1244 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-8304" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\sqrt{xy}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/state.json" "file_sha256" "f588af69fd6a70003e4b83c52e2208b3c81dd1ea2734b6e1b44421fe2bea8532" "basis" 1244 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-8304" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{xy}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =1 \\\\ \\sqrt{x}\\sqrt{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =1 \\\\ \\sqrt{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\sqrt{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\sqrt{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {y}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {x}^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}{y}^{3/2} & =2{x}^{1/2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}{y}^{3/2}=2{x}^{1/2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}{y}^{3/2} & =2{x}^{1/2}+C \\\\ {y}^{3/2} & =3{x}^{1/2}+\\frac{3C}{2} \\\\ y & ={(3{x}^{1/2}+\\frac{3C}{2})}^{2/3} \\\\ y & ={(3{x}^{1/2}+K)}^{2/3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=\\frac{3C}{2}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/state.json" "file_sha256" "f588af69fd6a70003e4b83c52e2208b3c81dd1ea2734b6e1b44421fe2bea8532" "basis" 1244 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-8304" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036385/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0ec922797d4c37acbca178